 threer:['Calming the body first gives you the power to choose your words.','God made a soft answer more powerful than a harsh one.','Proverbs 15:1|A soft answer turneth away wrath: but grievous words stir up anger.','James 1:19-20; Proverbs 29:11; Colossians 4:6','Prepare one calm sentence to use when words hit.'],
