 seewhole:['Redirecting attention retrains what the brain notices.','Every person bears God\'s image. Job made a covenant with his eyes.','Job 31:1|I made a covenant with mine eyes.','Genesis 1:27; Matthew 5:28; 1 Timothy 5:1-2; Psalm 119:37','Practise turning your eyes and blessing once today.'],
 cleaninputs:['Repeated inputs wire the brain; new inputs rewire it.','Scripture tells us to guard our hearts and set good things before our eyes.','Proverbs 4:23|Keep thy heart with all diligence; for out of it are the issues of life.','Psalm 101:3; Philippians 4:8; Romans 12:2','Unfollow three accounts that pull you down.'],
 speakout:['Speaking, hearing and repeating build stronger pathways.','God spoke creation into being, and He tells us to keep His word in our mouths.','Joshua 1:8|This book of the law shall not depart out of thy mouth.','Romans 10:17; Psalm 19:14; Proverbs 18:21','Say one verse aloud three times today.'],
